  triage:recommendedFix "Add a new section '## 30. Sprint X.4 Replay Persistence And IPC Consolidation' to docs/project-plan.md after section 29, documenting the X.4 sprint deliverables (replay-persistence startup contract, peer-transport decomposition, same-host helper deduplication) with explicit acceptance criteria and execution rules matching the style of prior sprint sections (X.1, X.2, X.3)" .

